        "role": "system",
        "content": "Return JSON {\"guard\":\"only two if statements\"}. No comments or other changes. Host inserts statements immediately BEFORE let property=null, AFTER current null/type/date guards. Existing null checks already return, so here trip and filters are both non-null objects."
